      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1350860595703,
        570.2670288085938,
        408.2497253417969,
        579.2670288085938
      ],
      "text": "and an increased likelihood of disseminated and extrapulmonary",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
